  "benefits": "&amp;amp;gt; **Financial Support:** \n\n\n\n      1. **First year:** ₹1,80,000/- per hectare.      1. **Second year:** ₹60,000/- per hectare.      1. **Third year:** ₹60,000/- per hectare.\n\n",
